{"parse": {"title": "飞渡往日-07", "pageid": 55489, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-06\" title=\"飞渡往日-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">飞渡往日-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-08\" title=\"飞渡往日-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">飞渡往日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9B.8F.E9.B8.9F.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"雏鸟们\">雏鸟们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 雏鸟们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Fledglings</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞鸟成群掠过海面，鸣叫着飞往西方。海浪一如千百年来那般冲洗着沙岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>有些好事的记者为佛罗里达编造了不少故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>失踪二十年的幽灵船神秘飘回了东海岸，迷失多年的飞机自大洋海底飞出，长翅膀的飞人宣称自己被外星人掳走……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>航天中心的同事聊起过这些传闻——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>一边嚼早餐玉米片，一边笑得拍桌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>把餐桌弄得一团糟，这不是件好事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>……从这片海岸往南，穿过巴哈马与波多黎各，再折向北边，与百慕大群岛形成三角区域，就在这片漂亮的海域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不相信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>未经验证的报道中往往存在大量误导，应该筛选出事实，而不是盲信传言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不觉得你会相信这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我只相信最后一个。我是说……我想去相信最后一个，万一它是真的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，也就是说你认为会有长翅膀的人类从大西洋西部海域出现，并降落在佛罗里达海岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>当你把维克多叔公丢掉的设计稿交给我的时候，我还很惊讶……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>但后来觉得，这可能是一种冥冥中的天意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天意，一个在机械女士看来毫无价值的名词，它仅仅意味着智慧种族在其蒙昧时代的恐惧与臆想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我没想过这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多不想把这件事做下去，那就交给别人做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没有比你更合适的人选，所以就由你来。就这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>1908年的失败不能说明这条道路是错误的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而维克多放弃了的项目最后又落到了他的亲戚手中，则是个纯粹的意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>或者说，一个纯粹的巧合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>这事要是让其他神秘学家知道，他们也会认为这是一种天意，是灵知和宿命的回归指引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>不过无论如何，我让孩子们跟我一起把这件事做下去了，你看——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>一分零八秒！是我赢了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>你放屁，明明是一分零一秒！你多报了七秒钟！那时候你还踩在地上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>发动机启动的时间就算！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>离开地面后我们才开始计算滞空时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>否则你会得到错误的实验数据，进而对后续研究产生误导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为首的孩子转头看向她，又看向机械女士身后的胡安娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>你是谁？你——欸？那个机器人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿，老师把机器人带来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>没有神秘术的辅助也能稳定滞空一分钟以上，嗯，这比以前好了不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>对露西女士尊重一些。要知道，你们那些宝贝翅膀的原型设计图可是她送来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>好的，老师！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>没问题，老师！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>还是老问题：少量液态燃料不能提供足够的续航。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>但如果要把油舱做大，需要的动力支持也会随之倍增，得不偿失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>不过孩子们很有信心，我们有足够的时间来慢慢调整设计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>也许现在还不够完美，没关系，像你说的，这只是个时间问题。他们还很年轻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>十六岁时解决不了的问题，我相信等他们六十岁的时候，就再不是问题了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>时间，是的，时间……燃煤取代风和水，燃油和电力又渐渐将煤炭挤下能源的王座。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>四十四年前人类刚发明了电视机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而现在他们已经离不开晶体管电视和晚上八点的影视剧了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>你们在聊电视？那你肯定知道詹姆斯·柯克船长和他的斯波克伙计！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>万一她没看过呢？你怎么敢这么断定！这不严谨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>她是机器人！怎么可能不知道这——么伟大的科幻片！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我想，这个话题可以就此打住了，除非你们俩想后天早上去义务打扫学校的游泳池。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>对吗，热爱劳动的好孩子们？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个轻飘飘的威胁，但足够让学生闭上那张叽叽喳喳吵个不停的嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>按照安排，他们应该和学校里的其他学生一起观看直播。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>科算中心打算推行新的测试信号转输技术在十万公里级别距离上的应用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不过在这之前，先来看看你们的麻烦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士走向那两对插在沙地里的金属设备，对人类少年的力气来说，能把上百斤重的装备带来海岸绝非易事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>丹和安妮，还有其他人一起帮忙搬来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-621220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅱ：</div><div>是的是的，我们答应好了，等翅膀做好，就让大家轮流用，让大家都能飞一飞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我帮他们把设备调试到最好了，你看到的就是我们能做到的极限了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>一分钟的成绩很不错。你就是为这个邀请我来的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我很怀念跟你共事的那段日子，露西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>这只是一位早早退休的工程师对她往昔生涯的一种怀念，以及对老朋友的好意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>当然，在这当中加上一点小小的请求，我想也没什么问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>飞行器用的是液态燃料吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>年初的那个版本是，航空中心的朋友一直在为我们提供少量燃油。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>但最近半年我们发现了问题：燃油的安全性和储能都有问题，所以现在改用电线了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如她所言，车载发电机延出了长长的黑色电线，连接着人群中央的黑色金属翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这会限制飞行器的活动范围。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>输电线的极限长度就是飞行器的飞行范围极限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你们或许只是做了一个能载人的电动风筝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>至少把风筝线换成了电线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是的，电动风筝……他们偶尔就会这样称呼它。但有什么别的办法吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>电池连接着发电机，只有这样才能稳定提供能源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>如果拔掉电线，那就像你刚才看到的：一分钟是大容量化学电池的极限。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>换句话说，只要能解决这个问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我想这不是一道难题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士敞开大衣口袋，分享了她为自己储备的收藏：一些块状金属制品，神秘学与材料科学结合的奇迹之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如果你们用的T-2型通用插槽，那它可以完美替代现在的电池。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>把舱盖打开，再把这个放进去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她走向有翼的机器，将新的心脏装入亮银舱盖中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，她拔下机翼下吊垂着的黑色脐带——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>再试试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>她换了什么东西进去，电池吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-561720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生Ⅰ：</div><div>就这么简单？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这应该能解决了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不要飞得太高，也不要远离海岸，控制好时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>胡安娜向她走来，而两名学生则跑向各自的机器，准备试试机械女士为他们提供的新玩意儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>那是什么？我没听说过航天基地在研究电池技术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是我和科算中心在1965年完成的一个项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>有赖于神秘学家同事的协助，这种电池突破了某些物理材料的限制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>神秘学家？噢，那这东西已经到量产阶段了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很快就会，行政部门正在处理相关的文书工作，技术上完全成熟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>稳定可控的神秘术咒文和基地仓库里存放的航空燃油没有区别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>石油工业构筑起了现代文明的基石，那么已经解明了的、能够完美重现的神秘术也可以作为这栋大厦的支柱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>我还以为你会反对神秘术在科学领域的应用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>加上定语，“不稳定的”神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>当我们找到了控制它的方法，它就是一项可供利用的助力，像河流驱动大坝，一旦驯服洪水，大河就是我们的发电机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而人类或是神秘学家，或是一台电冰箱，胡安娜，我不认为有什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>数字编码设计的智能机械和基因编码创造出的智能生物，本质上说，一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>如果换别人说这种话，我一定会认为他疯了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>语言不会因人而异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>机械装置在不同的人手中都有着同样的性能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>每个孩子都能握着操纵杆享受俯瞰海岸的快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>铝翼的飞鸟从海岸缓缓飞起。在秒表计时的紧张计数中，人群数出了一个又一个百秒的极限数字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是的，你的学生很享受飞行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>是啊，很享受……一种纯粹的快乐，不为了跟外国人竞争，不为政治宣传而飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它完成得比我想象中轻松很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>水到渠成嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>要我替你把相关设计提交给航天基地吗？科算中心也行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>不用，我想再等等，有些东西还可以再优化。对了，你预计它能飞多久？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不知道，但肯定比你们之前久得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>那就叫他们下来。这些孩子一激动就容易沉浸在飞行里，趁他们还没被冲昏脑子……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-513901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>山姆，下来。丹和彼得帮帮忙，清理沙滩，让山姆落地，欢迎我们的英雄——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有翼的小飞人听到老师呼唤，不情不愿地带着身后的金属机械回到沙滩，稳稳落回大地母亲的怀抱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>十分零四十八秒，不错的成绩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">胡安娜：</div><div>下一次我们会做得更好，一定会。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞渡往日-07"}}